{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    
    The code must be placed in ONE Shopify section file.
    with view all products button with links in all plant image
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};padding:clamp(32px,5vw,68px) 20px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}:after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-90px;top:-100px;width:380px;height:380px;border-radius:50%;opacity:.2;pointer-events:none;background:repeating-conic-gradient({{ block.settings.accent_color }} 0deg 7deg,transparent 7deg 18deg);mask-image:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 0 26%,#000 27% 65%,transparent 66%)}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{position:relative;z-index:1;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:1400px;margin:auto}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:16px;margin-bottom:22px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font:clamp(28px,4vw,44px)/1.1 Georgia,serif;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};margin:0}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{color:{{ block.settings.green_color }};font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all{border:1px solid {{ block.settings.green_color }};border-radius:999px;padding:11px 18px;color:{{ block.settings.green_color }};font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:18px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;padding:4px 3px 16px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3);min-width:0;scroll-snap-align:start;background:{{ block.settings.card_color }};border-radius:{{ block.settings.card_radius }}px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 5px 18px #17331c14;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 12px 28px #17331c24}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1.08/1;background:#f1efe8;overflow:hidden}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .4s ease}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img{transform:scale(1.035)}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{width:100%;height:100%}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__off{position:absolute;top:12px;border-radius:99px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{left:12px;color:#fff;background:{{ block.settings.green_color }}}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__off{right:12px;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};color:#263020}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content{padding:16px;position:relative;min-height:166px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating{display:inline-block;background:#f4f0da;color:#263020;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:9px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name{font:600 clamp(17px,1.7vw,22px)/1.2 Georgia,serif;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};margin:0 42px 6px 0}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};margin:0 30px 13px 0}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{font-size:17px;font-weight:750;color:{{ block.settings.green_color }}}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare{font-size:13px;text-decoration:line-through;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }}}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:14px;width:42px;height:42px;border:0;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:{{ block.settings.green_color }};color:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .2s}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add:hover{transform:scale(1.07)}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.green_color }};background:#fff;color:{{ block.settings.green_color }};font-size:20px;cursor:pointer}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next{background:{{ block.settings.green_color }};color:#fff}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:disabled{opacity:.45}@media(max-width:900px){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2)}}@media(max-width:600px){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:34px 16px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{width:100%}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:84%}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav{display:none}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all{padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{scroll-behavior:auto}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><header class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head"><div>{% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}<p class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>{% endif %}<h2 class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2></div>{% if block.settings.all_link != blank %}<a class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all" href="{{ block.settings.all_link }}">{{ block.settings.all_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</header><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav"><button type="button" class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" data-direction="-1" aria-label="Previous plants">←</button><button type="button" class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next" data-direction="1" aria-label="Next plants">→</button></div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" role="region" aria-label="Plant products">{% for product in block.settings.products %}<article class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image">{% if forloop.index <= 3 and block.settings.show_bestseller %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ block.settings.bestseller_text | escape }}</span>{% endif %}{% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}{% assign discount_amount = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__off">{{ discount_amount }}% OFF</span>{% endif %}{% if product.featured_image %}<a href="{{ product.url }}" aria-label="View {{ product.title | escape }}"><img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}"></a>{% else %}<div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content"><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating">★ {{ block.settings.rating }} | {{ block.settings.reviews }}</div><h3 class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name">{{ product.title | escape }}</h3><p class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc">{{ product.description | strip_html | truncate: 75 }}</p><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices"><span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ product.price | money }}</span>{% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% endif %}</div>{% assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}<form method="post" action="/cart/add"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ variant.id }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><button type="submit" class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add" aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }} to cart"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 12H4L5 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M9 9V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></button></form></div></article>{% endfor %}</div></div></plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){const tag='plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class PlantCarousel extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.track=this.querySelector('.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track');this.querySelectorAll('[data-direction]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const card=this.track.querySelector('.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card');if(card)this.track.scrollBy({left:Number(button.dataset.direction)*(card.getBoundingClientRect().width+18),behavior:'smooth'})}))}}customElements.define(tag,PlantCarousel)})();</script>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Plant product carousel","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"Grown with care"},{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Find your next favourite plant"},{"type":"text","id":"all_label","label":"View all label","default":"View all plants"},{"type":"url","id":"all_link","label":"View all link"},{"type":"product_list","id":"products","label":"Plant products","limit":12},{"type":"text","id":"rating","label":"Rating display","default":"4.8"},{"type":"text","id":"reviews","label":"Review count display","default":"440"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_bestseller","label":"Show bestseller on first three cards","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"bestseller_text","label":"Bestseller text","default":"Bestseller"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#FFF9E8"},{"type":"color","id":"card_color","label":"Card background","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"color","id":"green_color","label":"Green","default":"#1F5130"},{"type":"color","id":"accent_color","label":"Accent","default":"#FFD60A"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#14231A"},{"type":"color","id":"muted_color","label":"Secondary text","default":"#5B6660"},{"type":"range","id":"card_radius","label":"Card corner radius","min":0,"max":32,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":16}],"presets":[{"name":"Plant product carousel"}],"tag":null,"class":"plant-carousel-block"}
{% endschema %}